#: includes/abilities.php:1189
msgid ""
"Runs a taxonomy-filtered, paginated query over published posts and returns "
"the results together with a shareable filter URL. Only taxonomies reported "
"by jpkcom-post-filter/list-filters are accepted; any other taxonomy key is "
"rejected with an error naming the valid ones."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:1202
msgid ""
"Post type to query. Must be enabled for filtering on this site. Defaults to "
"\"post\"."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:1207
msgid ""
"Taxonomy filters as a map of taxonomy key to a list of term slugs, for "
"example {\"category\":[\"news\"],\"post_tag\":[\"seo\"]}. Terms within one "
"taxonomy are combined with OR, different taxonomies with AND."
msgstr ""

