msgstr "Wählen Sie die bestehende WordPress-Taxonomie für diesen Filter aus."

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1472 includes/admin-pages.php:1679
msgid "Rewrite Slug"
msgstr "Rewrite-Slug"

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1478 includes/admin-pages.php:1684
msgid ""
"URL rewrite slug for this custom taxonomy (e.g. \"my-topics\"). Defaults to "
"the taxonomy name if left empty."
msgstr ""
"URL-Rewrite-Slug für diese Taxonomie (z. B. \"meine-themen\"). Standard: der "
"Taxonomie-Name, wenn leer gelassen."

