#: includes/admin-pages.php:1494 includes/admin-pages.php:1699
msgid "Uncheck for tag-like behaviour (flat list, no parent/child)."
msgstr ""
"Deaktivieren für tag-ähnliches Verhalten (flache Liste, keine Hierarchie)."

