msgid "Public"
msgstr "Öffentlich"

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1508 includes/admin-pages.php:1712
msgid "Enable term archive pages (public = true)"
msgstr "Term-Archivseiten aktivieren (public = true)"

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1510 includes/admin-pages.php:1714
msgid ""
"Enables frontend URLs for individual terms (e.g. /my-taxonomy/my-term/). "
"Note: WordPress does not create a taxonomy index page — only per-term "
"archives are generated. Disable for purely internal taxonomies."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviert Frontend-URLs für einzelne Terms (z. B. /meine-taxonomie/mein-"
"term/). Hinweis: WordPress erstellt keine Taxonomie-Indexseite – es werden "
"nur Term-Archive generiert. Für rein interne Taxonomien deaktivieren."

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1514 includes/admin-pages.php:1718
msgid "Admin Column"
msgstr "Admin-Spalte"

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1524 includes/admin-pages.php:1727
msgid "Show as column in post list (show_admin_column = true)"
msgstr "Als Spalte in der Beitragsliste anzeigen (show_admin_column = true)"

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1526 includes/admin-pages.php:1729
msgid ""
"Adds a column for this taxonomy to the post list table in the WordPress "
"admin."
msgstr ""
"Fügt der Beitragslisten-Tabelle im WordPress-Admin eine Spalte für diese "
"Taxonomie hinzu."

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1530 includes/admin-pages.php:1733
msgid "REST API"
msgstr "REST-API"

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1540 includes/admin-pages.php:1742
msgid "Expose in REST API (show_in_rest = true)"
msgstr "In der REST-API verfügbar machen (show_in_rest = true)"

#: includes/admin-pages.php:1542 includes/admin-pages.php:1744
msgid ""
"Required for the Block Editor (Gutenberg). Disable only for purely server-"
